(3781, 1, '2013-10-05 09:00:52', '2013-10-05 09:00:52', '[scroll_animation relative=\"no\" start=\"0\" end=\"800\" from=\" left:0px; top: 40%;\" to=\" left:0px; top:70%;\"]<a href=\"https://barqaab.com.-content/uploads/2013/10/BARQAAB_HEADING2.png\"><img class=\"alignleft size-full wp-image-4036\" src=\"https://barqaab.com.-content/uploads/2013/10/BARQAAB_HEADING2.png\" alt=\"BARQAAB_HEADING2\" width=\"708\" height=\"96\" /></a>\r\n[/scroll_animation]\r\n\r\n[scroll_animation relative=\"no\" start=\"0\" end=\"800\" from=\" right:0px; top: 55%; \" to=\" right:0px; top:100%; \"]<a href=\"https://barqaab.com.-content/uploads/2013/10/Barqaab_Tagline2.png\"><img class=\"alignright size-full wp-image-4037\" src=\"https://barqaab.com.-content/uploads/2013/10/Barqaab_Tagline2.png\" alt=\"Barqaab_Tagline2\" width=\"772\" height=\"73\" /></a>\r\n[/scroll_animation]', 'Home Slide Two', '', 'draft', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'slide-two', '', '', '2014-11-27 06:19:26', '2014-11-27 06:19:26', '', 0, 'http://localhost/wordpress/?post_type=super_slider&#038;p=3781', 0, 'super_slider', '', 0),
(4048, 1, '2014-11-13 05:56:50', '2014-11-13 05:56:50', '[column_third]\n<a href=\"https://barqaab.com.-content/uploads/2014/11/LOGO_BARQAAB_Monotone_black_450.png\"><img class=\"aligncenter wp-image-4129 size-full\" src=\"https://barqaab.com.-content/uploads/2016/12/bqb_logo_450.jpg\" alt=\"BARQAAB\" width=\"450\" height=\"451\" /></a>\n[/column_third]\n[column_two_thirds]\nBARQAAB has successfully implemented a large number of important projects independently and as a joint venture partner. BARQAAB is proud of independently planning, designing and supervising the construction of Rainee Canal Project including its Headwork of 10,000 cusecs at Guddu Barrage, 111km main/branch canal, 133km distributary and minor canals and 394 structures of various types. Hardly any other consultant has independently planned, designed and implemented a canal project of this size and nature. Other water sector projects include Muzaffargarh Canal Rehabilitation and Lining Project (as Lead Firm), Mangla Dam Raising Project and Khanki Barrage (as a major JV partner).\n\nBARQAAB also has the credit of being a major JV partner for the detailed design of Diamer Basha Dam Project – the highest roller compacted concrete dam in the world. BARQAAB independently carried out the feasibility of 10,000 cusecs Mangla-Marala Link Canal and the feasibility studies of a large number of dams in all the four provinces and in FATA. BARQAAB has recently completed feasibility study of Dadhocha Dam and is presently carrying out feasibility of UJC as a lead firm in the JV. BARQAAB was also associated as a JV partner for design of lining of Rice Canal, Dadu Canal, Rohri Canal, KB Feeder Canal, Phuleli Canal and Pinyari Canal in Sindh and is presently working as a JV partner for the construction supervision of Jhamrao Canal lining and rehabilitation project. BARQAAB was a JV partner for the detailed design and construction supervision of RBOD III project.\n[/column_two_thirds]\n<p class=\"style1\" align=\"justify\">[column_full]\nBARQAAB’s consultancy services cover all engineering disciplines but its main field of experience is the water and power resources development projects. Scope of services provided in these sectors cover planning including surveys, field investigations, project identification, concept papers, pre-feasibility and feasibility studies, ranking studies and prioritization, detailed design &amp; implementation of irrigation, drainage, dam and hydropower projects. BARQAAB also specializes in hydrogeological characteristics for groundwater management.</p>\nAll BARQAAB Offices are ISO 9001:2015, 14001:2015 and 45001:2018 Certified.\n<h2>[/column_full]</h2>\n[parallax_section background=\"https://barqaab.com.-content/uploads/2014/11/barqaab_graphic3.jpg\"]\n[scroll_animation relative=\"yes\" start=\"-50\" end=\"-350\" from=\"top:400px;\" to=\"top:0px;\"]\n<h1>BARQAAB</h1>\n<h6>Pursuing Excellence In Consultancy &amp; Advisory Services For Water &amp; Power Projects</h6>\n[/scroll_animation]\n\n[/parallax_section]', 'ABOUT US', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', 'barqaab', '', '', '2025-06-18 10:07:58', '2025-06-18 10:07:58', '', 0, 'http://localhost/wp3/?page_id=4048', 1, 'page', '', 0),
(4735, 2, '2023-03-06 06:36:20', '2023-03-06 06:36:20', '[column_third]\n<a href=\"https://barqaab.com.-content/uploads/2014/11/LOGO_BARQAAB_Monotone_black_450.png\"><img class=\"aligncenter wp-image-4129 size-full\" src=\"https://barqaab.com.-content/uploads/2016/12/bqb_logo_450.jpg\" alt=\"BARQAAB\" width=\"450\" height=\"451\" /></a>\n[/column_third]\n[column_two_thirds]\nBARQAAB has successfully implemented a large number of important projects independently and as a joint venture partner. BARQAAB is proud of independently planning, designing and supervising the construction of Rainee Canal Project including its Headwork of 10,000 cusecs at Guddu Barrage, 111km main/branch canal, 133km distributary and minor canals and 394 structures of various types. Hardly any other consultant has independently planned, designed and implemented a canal project of this size and nature. Other water sector projects include Muzaffargarh Canal Rehabilitation and Lining Project (as Lead Firm), Mangla Dam Raising Project and Khanki Barrage (as a major JV partner).\n\nBARQAAB also has the credit of being a major JV partner for the detailed design of Diamer Basha Dam Project – the highest roller compacted concrete dam in the world. BARQAAB independently carried out the feasibility of 10,000 cusecs Mangla-Marala Link Canal and the feasibility studies of a large number of dams in all the four provinces and in FATA. BARQAAB has recently completed feasibility study of Dadhocha Dam and is presently carrying out feasibility of UJC as a lead firm in the JV. BARQAAB was also associated as a JV partner for design of lining of Rice Canal, Dadu Canal, Rohri Canal, KB Feeder Canal, Phuleli Canal and Pinyari Canal in Sindh and is presently working as a JV partner for the construction supervision of Jhamrao Canal lining and rehabilitation project. BARQAAB was a JV partner for the detailed design and construction supervision of RBOD III project.\n[/column_two_thirds]\n<p class=\"style1\" align=\"justify\">[column_full]\nBARQAAB’s consultancy services cover all engineering disciplines but its main field of experience is the water and power resources development projects. Scope of services provided in these sectors cover planning including surveys, field investigations, project identification, concept papers, pre-feasibility and feasibility studies, ranking studies and prioritization, detailed design &amp; implementation of irrigation, drainage, dam and hydropower projects. BARQAAB also specializes in hydrogeological characteristics for groundwater management.\n\nAll BARQAAB Offices are ISO 9001:2008 Certified.</p>\n\n<h2>[/column_full]</h2>\n[parallax_section background=\"https://barqaab.com.-content/uploads/2014/11/barqaab_graphic3.jpg\"]\n[scroll_animation relative=\"yes\" start=\"-50\" end=\"-350\" from=\"top:400px;\" to=\"top:0px;\"]\n<h1>BARQAAB</h1>\n<h6>Pursuing Excellence In Consultancy &amp; Advisory Services For Water &amp; Power Projects</h6>\n[/scroll_animation]\n\n[/parallax_section]', 'ABOUT US', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '4048-revision-v1', '', '', '2023-03-06 06:36:20', '2023-03-06 06:36:20', '', 4048, 'https://www.barqaab.com.pk/2023/03/4048-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(4114, 1, '2014-11-14 05:54:54', '2014-11-14 05:54:54', '[column_two_thirds]\r\nSince it\'s establishment, BARQAAB has come a long way to become an epitome of excellence in the field of engineering consultancy. Over these years, the Company undertook 168 projects costing in excess of Rs.800 Billion. The fundamental principle in the implementation of these projects always remained the pursuit of excellence through hard work and honesty.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nAt BARQAAB, we feel proud of the incomparable expertise and competence of a dedicated team of 450 professionals. Meeting the expectations of our clients and justifying their trust remains the hallmark of our business strategy.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nThe Company plans to expand its business overseas. We have already signed an MOU with Mohammad Alshehhi Power L.L.C. Dubai to jointly undertake foreign and local projects. It is our expectation that the Company will continue to grow, both in the qualitative and quantitative aspects of its business. May Allah help us in this endeavor. Ameen.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<strong>Engr. Ahmad Khan Bhatti</strong>\r\nChief Executive Officer\r\n[/column_two_thirds]\r\n[column_third_last]\r\n\r\n<a href=\"https://barqaab.com.-content/uploads/2014/11/CEO_500px.jpg\"><img class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-4120\" src=\"https://barqaab.com.-content/uploads/2014/11/CEO_500px.jpg\" alt=\"CEO_500px\" width=\"500\" height=\"483\" /></a>\r\n[/column_third_last]', 'CEO MESSAGE', '', 'private', 'open', 'open', '', 'ceo-message', '', '', '2016-12-02 09:36:56', '2016-12-02 09:36:56', '', 0, 'http://localhost/wp3/?page_id=4114', 2, 'page', '', 0),
