(4147, 1, '2014-11-18 06:58:30', '2014-11-18 06:58:30', '[column_full]\r\n<h1 class=\"giga\">84 MW </span></h1><h1 class=\"giga\">GORKIN-MATILTAN<span class=\"accent\"> HYDROPOWER PROJECT</span></h1>\r\n[/column_full]\r\n[column_full]\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-3983\" src=\"https://barqaab.com.-content/uploads/2014/11/matiltan.jpg\" alt=\"Mangla Dam\" width=\"1100\" />\r\n[/column_full]\r\n[column_two_thirds]\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The Government of Khyber Pakhtunkhwah (KPK) has decided to undertake implementation of 84 MW Matiltan Hydropower Project, district Swat through Sarhad Hydel Organization (PHYDO) as the Executing Agency.  BARQAAB in joint venture with two other local firms is providing Consultancy Services for the construction of 84 MW HPP. This consultancy agreement was signed on 17th April, 2012 between PHYDO and BARQAAB Consultancy Services, (PVT) Ltd Lahore.</p>\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align: left;\">Scope of Work</h4>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">BARQAAB is responsible for preparing Basic Design of the Project and Draft EPC Contract Documents based on FIDIC Conditions of Contract for EPC/Turnkey projects.  BARQAAB will monitor, review and supervise the EPC contractor engineering, procurement, contract administration and construction activities.</p>\r\n\r\n[/column_two_thirds]\r\n[column_third]\r\n<p style=\"padding:50px 0px 50px 0px; border-style: dashed; border-width: 1px; font-weight:bold;\">Total Project Cost: PKR 15,800 Million.\r\nBARQAAB Share: 60%.\r\nDate of Commencement: May 2012.\r\nDate of Completion: June 2016.</p>\r\n[/column_third]', '84 MW GORKIN-MATILTAN HYDROPOWER PROJECT', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', '84-mw-gorkin-matiltan-hydropower-project', '', '', '2014-11-18 07:26:33', '2014-11-18 07:26:33', '', 0, 'http://barqaab.com.pk/?post_type=portfolios&#038;p=4147', 7, 'portfolios', '', 0),
(4143, 1, '2014-11-18 08:06:31', '2014-11-18 08:06:31', '[column_full]\r\n<h1 class=\"giga\">MANGLA DAM RAISING <h1><h2 span class=\"accent\">DETAILED ENGINEERING DESIGN, TENDER DOCUMENTATION AND CONSTRUCTION SUPERVISION</span></h2>\r\n[/column_full]\r\n[column_full]\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-3983\" src=\"http://www.barqaab.com/mainwebsite/img/slider2.jpg\" alt=\"Mangla Dam\" width=\"1100\" />\r\n[/column_full]\r\n[column_two_thirds]\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">BARQAAB is providing technical expert services in the Project for the detailed engineering and tender documents in Phase-II, provide experts in bidding and award of construction contacts in phase-III A and also conduct construction supervision in phase-III B. BARQAAB Share is 17%.The Mangla Dam Raising Project involves raising of main and auxiliary dams, modification of the Headwork & orifice of the main spillway and construction of a control weir for the emergency spillway. Mangla Dam is to regain the storage capacity lost due to sedimentation in the reservoir.  The average annual water availability for irrigation releases will increase by 2.88 MAF.  To achieve other benefits like increase in annual energy output by 772 GWh which is equivalent to 150 MW in generating capacity, development of fisheries and increased economic in the area.</p>\r\n[/column_two_thirds]\r\n[column_third]\r\n<p style=\"padding:50px 0px 50px 0px; border-style: dashed; border-width: 1px; font-weight:bold;\">Total Project Cost: PKR 62,500 Million.\r\nBARQAAB Share: 33%.\r\nDate of Commencement: August 2002.\r\nDate of Completion: December 2010.</p>\r\n[/column_third]', 'MANGLA DAM RAISING PROJECT – DETAILED ENGINEERING DESIGN', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'mangla-dam-raising-project-detailed-engineering-design', '', '', '2014-11-21 09:26:08', '2014-11-21 09:26:08', '', 0, 'http://barqaab.com.pk/?post_type=portfolios&#038;p=4143', 4, 'portfolios', '', 0),
(4144, 1, '2014-11-18 06:50:07', '2014-11-18 06:50:07', '[column_full]\r\n<h1 class=\"giga\">BASHA DIAMER DAM PROJECT </h1><h3>REVIEW AND UPGRADATION OF PRELIMINARY FEASIBILITY STUDY</h3>\r\n[/column_full]\r\n[column_full]\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-3983\" src=\"https://barqaab.com.-content/uploads/2014/11/slider1.jpg\" alt=\"Mangla Dam\" width=\"1100\" />\r\n[/column_full]\r\n[column_two_thirds]\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Project layout for the different types of dam was developed selecting the type of Dam. Optimization studies for each alternative considered taking into account. Preparation of feasibility level designs of all structures for the selected, alternative including general layout. Economic analysis, costing and preparation of PC-1 of the Project including telecom and SCADA system. Basha Dam proposed site is located near Chillas on river Indus and shall have a live storage capacity of 7.34 MAF.  It shall have a power potential of 4500 MW.  This project is a part of WAPDA’s Vision 2025 Programme and aims at enhancing the irrigation and power availability of the country.  This dam is located in a highly seismic zone and is extremely high and involves relocation and upgradation of KKH which gets submerged for 130-Km length.  The Consultants have been selected by WAPDA to upgrade the feasibility and carry out various investigations required for the Project.</p>\r\n[/column_two_thirds]\r\n[column_third]\r\n<p style=\"padding:50px 0px 50px 0px; border-style: dashed; border-width: 1px; font-weight:bold;\">Total Project Cost: PKR 6.4 Billion.\r\nBARQAAB Share: 33%.\r\nDate of Commencement: August 2002.\r\nDate of Completion: December 2004.</p>\r\n[/column_third]', 'REVIEW AND UPGRADATION OF PRELIMINARY FEASIBILITY STUDY OF BASHA DIAMER DAM PROJECT.', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'review-and-upgradation-of-preliminary-feasibility-study-of-basha-diamer-dam-project', '', '', '2014-11-21 09:26:18', '2014-11-21 09:26:18', '', 0, 'http://barqaab.com.pk/?post_type=portfolios&#038;p=4144', 6, 'portfolios', '', 0),
(4145, 1, '2014-11-18 06:48:14', '2014-11-18 06:48:14', '', 'slider1', '', 'inherit', 'open', 'open', '', 'slider1', '', '', '2014-11-18 06:48:14', '2014-11-18 06:48:14', '', 4144, 'http://barqaab.com.pk/wp-content/uploads/2014/11/slider1.jpg', 0, 'attachment', 'image/jpeg', 0),
(4146, 1, '2014-11-18 06:51:16', '2014-11-18 06:51:16', '[column_full]\n<h1 class=\"giga\">BASHA DIAMER DAM PROJECT </h1><h3>OF PRELIMINARY FEASIBILITY STUDY OF BASHA DIAMER DAM PROJECT</h3>\n[/column_full]\n[column_full]\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-3983\" src=\"https://barqaab.com.-content/uploads/2014/11/slider1.jpg\" alt=\"Mangla Dam\" width=\"1100\" />\n[/column_full]\n[column_two_thirds]\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Project layout for the different types of dam was developed selecting the type of Dam. Optimization studies for each alternative considered taking into account. Preparation of feasibility level designs of all structures for the selected, alternative including general layout. Economic analysis, costing and preparation of PC-1 of the Project including telecom and SCADA system.\n\nBasha Dam proposed site is located near Chillas on river Indus and shall have a live storage capacity of 7.34 MAF.  It shall have a power potential of 4500 MW.  This project is a part of WAPDA’s Vision 2025 Programme and aims at enhancing the irrigation and power availability of the country.  This dam is located in a highly seismic zone and is extremely high and involves relocation and upgradation of KKH which gets submerged for 130-Km length.  The Consultants have been selected by WAPDA to upgrade the feasibility and carry out various investigations required for the Project.</p>\n[/column_two_thirds]\n[column_third]\n<p style=\"padding:50px 0px 50px 0px; border-style: dashed; border-width: 1px; font-weight:bold;\">Total Project Cost: PKR 6.4 Billion.\nBarqaab Share: 33%.\nDate of Commencement: August 2002.\nDate of Completion: December 2004.</p>\n[/column_third]', 'REVIEW AND UPGRADATION OF PRELIMINARY FEASIBILITY STUDY OF BASHA DIAMER DAM PROJECT.', '', 'inherit', 'open', 'open', '', '4144-autosave-v1', '', '', '2014-11-18 06:51:16', '2014-11-18 06:51:16', '', 4144, 'http://barqaab.com.pk/2014/11/4144-autosave-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(4148, 1, '2014-11-18 07:19:57', '2014-11-18 07:19:57', '[column_full]\n<h1 class=\"giga\">84 MW GORKIN MATILTAN<span class=\"accent\">HYDROPOWER PROJECT</span></h1>\n[/column_full]\n[column_full]\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-3983\" src=\"https://barqaab.com.-content/uploads/2014/11/matiltan.jpg\" alt=\"Mangla Dam\" width=\"1100\" />\n[/column_full]\n[column_two_thirds]\n<h4>Introudction<h4>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The Government of Khyber Pakhtunkhwah (KPK) has decided to undertake implementation of 84 MW Matiltan Hydropower Project, district Swat through Sarhad Hydel Organization (PHYDO) as the Executing Agency.  BARQAAB in joint venture with two other local firms is providing Consultancy Services for the construction of 84 MW HPP. This consultancy agreement was signed on 17th April, 2012 between PHYDO and BARQAAB Consultancy Services, (PVT) Ltd Lahore.</p>\n<h4>Scope of Work<h4>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">BARQAAB is responsible for preparing Basic Design of the Project and Draft EPC Contract Documents based on FIDIC Conditions of Contract for EPC/Turnkey projects.  BARQAAB will monitor, review and supervise the EPC contractor engineering, procurement, contract administration and construction activities.</p>\n\n[/column_two_thirds]\n[column_third]\n<p style=\"padding:50px 0px 50px 0px; border-style: dashed; border-width: 1px; font-weight:bold;\">Total Project Cost: PKR 15,800 Million.\nBARQAAB Share: 60%.\nDate of Commencement: May 2012.\nDate of Completion: June 2016.</p>\n[/column_third]', '84 MW GORKIN-MATILTAN HYDROPOWER PROJECT', '', 'inherit', 'open', 'open', '', '4147-autosave-v1', '', '', '2014-11-18 07:19:57', '2014-11-18 07:19:57', '', 4147, 'http://barqaab.com.pk/2014/11/4147-autosave-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
