(4165, 1, '2014-11-18 09:15:46', '2014-11-18 09:15:46', '[column_full]\r\n<h1 class=\"giga\">FOUR SMALL DAMS <span class=\"accent\"> PACKAGE-A</span></h1><h3>DETAILED DESIGN AND CONSTRUCTION SUPERVISION</h3>\r\n[/column_full]\r\n[column_two_thirds]\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Detailed Design and Construction Supervision of 4 Small Dams in District Karak, KPK under Package – A.  construction of Karak Dam and Loughar Dam has been completed. The other two - Mardan Khal & Ghole Banda Dam are in progress.<BR>The Joint Venture / Consortium was responsible for all office and field activities of the Project which includes Planning of investigation work including topographic surveys, hydrological studies, geotechnical investigations, hydraulic and structural design, design of dam spillway intake arrangement and other appurtenant structures. </p>\r\n\r\n[/column_two_thirds]\r\n[column_third]\r\n<p style=\"padding:50px 0px 50px 0px; border-style: dashed; border-width: 1px; font-weight:bold;\">\r\nTotal Project Cost: PKR 18,500 Million.\r\nBarqaab Share: 35%\r\nDate of Commencement: April 2005\r\nDate of Completion: January 2006\r\n[/column_third]', '4 SMALL DAMS PACKAGE-A', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', '4-small-dams-package-a', '', '', '2014-11-18 09:15:46', '2014-11-18 09:15:46', '', 0, 'http://barqaab.com.pk/?post_type=portfolios&#038;p=4165', 11, 'portfolios', '', 0),
(4166, 1, '2014-11-18 09:18:41', '2014-11-18 09:18:41', '[column_full]\r\n<h1 class=\"giga\">FIVE SMALL DAMS <span class=\"accent\"> PACKAGE-B</span></h1><h2>( DISTRICT KARAK )</h2>\r\n[/column_full]\r\n[column_two_thirds]\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The Joint Venture / Consortium was responsible for all office and field activities of the Project which includes Planning of investigation work including topographic surveys, hydrological studies, geotechnical investigations, hydraulic and structural design, design of dam spillway intake arrangement and other appurtenant structures. <BR><BR>Review of available studies, data, planning and supervision of additional investigations, carrying out detailed Feasibility Studies.</p>\r\n\r\n[/column_two_thirds]\r\n[column_third]\r\n<p style=\"padding:50px 0px 50px 0px; border-style: dashed; border-width: 1px; font-weight:bold;\">\r\nTotal Project Cost: PKR 18,500 Million.\r\nBarqaab Share: 35%\r\nDate of Commencement: April 2005\r\nDate of Completion: January 2006\r\n[/column_third]', '5 SMALL DAMS IN DISTRICT KARAK PACKAGE - B', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', '5-small-dams-in-district-karak-package-b', '', '', '2014-11-18 09:19:53', '2014-11-18 09:19:53', '', 0, 'http://barqaab.com.pk/?post_type=portfolios&#038;p=4166', 12, 'portfolios', '', 0),
(4167, 1, '2014-11-18 09:22:57', '2014-11-18 09:22:57', '[column_full]\r\n<h1 class=\"giga\">THREE SMALL DAMS <span class=\"accent\"> PACKAGE-B</span></h1><h2>( KHYBER PAKHTUNKHWA )</h2>\r\n[/column_full]\r\n[column_two_thirds]\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The Joint Venture / Consortium was responsible for all office and field activities of the Project which includes Planning of investigation work including topographic surveys, hydrological studies, geotechnical investigations, hydraulic and structural design, design of dam spillway intake arrangement and other appurtenant structures. <BR><BR>Review of available studies, data, planning and supervision of additional investigations, carrying out detailed Feasibility Studies.</p>\r\n\r\n[/column_two_thirds]\r\n[column_third]\r\n<p style=\"padding:50px 0px 50px 0px; border-style: dashed; border-width: 1px; font-weight:bold;\">\r\nTotal Project Cost: PKR 14,200 Million.\r\nBarqaab Share: 35%\r\nDate of Commencement: April 2005\r\nDate of Completion: January 2006\r\n[/column_third]', '3 SMALL DAMS IN KPK PACKAGE - C', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', '3-small-dams-in-kpk-package-c', '', '', '2014-11-18 09:22:57', '2014-11-18 09:22:57', '', 0, 'http://barqaab.com.pk/?post_type=portfolios&#038;p=4167', 13, 'portfolios', '', 0),
