fy\">[column_full]\nBARQAAB’s consultancy services cover all engineering disciplines but its main field of experience is the water and power resources development projects. Scope of services provided in these sectors cover planning including surveys, field investigations, project identification, concept papers, pre-feasibility and feasibility studies, ranking studies and prioritization, detailed design &amp; implementation of irrigation, drainage, dam and hydropower projects. BARQAAB also specializes in hydrogeological characteristics for groundwater management.</p>\nAll BARQAAB Offices are ISO 9001:2008 Certified.\n<h2>[/column_full]</h2>\n[parallax_section background=\"https://barqaab.com.-content/uploads/2014/11/barqaab_graphic3.jpg\"]\n[scroll_animation relative=\"yes\" start=\"-50\" end=\"-350\" from=\"top:400px;\" to=\"top:0px;\"]\n<h1>BARQAAB</h1>\n<h6>Pursuing Excellence In Consultancy &amp; Advisory Services For Water &amp; Power Projects</h6>\n[/scroll_animation]\n\n[/parallax_section]', 'ABOUT US', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '4048-revision-v1', '', '', '2023-03-06 06:42:37', '2023-03-06 06:42:37', '', 4048, 'https://www.barqaab.com.pk/2023/03/4048-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(4428, 1, '2014-11-24 04:05:27', '2014-11-24 04:05:27', 'At Barqaab, we\'re committed to pursue excellence in consultancy and advisory services for water and power projects. We are equally committed to helping exceptional people comprehend their potential as we reward them with opportunity and challenge. We value teamwork, accountability, integrity and treat all employees with dignity and respect.\r\nWe offer competitive salaries and health care benefits. We have systems in place for employees to receive recognition for their individual performance and the overall success of the organization.\r\n<strong><h5><a title=\"Submit CV\" href=\"https://barqaab.com.-cv/\">Submit Your CV</a></h5></strong>', 'CAREERS', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', 'careers', '', '', '2014-11-27 07:17:21', '2014-11-27 07:17:21', '', 0, 'http://barqaab.com.pk/?page_id=4428', 0, 'page', '', 0),
(4449, 1, '2014-11-27 07:12:46', '2014-11-27 07:12:46', 'At Barqaab, we\'re committed to pursue excellence in consultancy and advisory services for water and power projects. We are equally committed to helping exceptional people comprehend their potential as we reward them with opportunity and challenge. We value teamwork, accountability, integrity and treat all employees with dignity and respect.\r\n\r\n<BR>We offer competitive salaries and health care benefits. We have systems in place for employees to receive recognition for their individual performance and the overall success of the organization.\r\n', 'CAREERS', '', 'inherit', 'open', 'open', '', '4428-revision-v1', '', '', '2014-11-27 07:12:46', '2014-11-27 07:12:46', '', 4428, 'http://barqaab.com.pk/2014/11/4428-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(4454, 1, '2014-11-27 08:33:27', '2014-11-27 08:33:27', '[column_two_thirds]\r\nSince it\'s establishment, BARQAAB has come a long way to become an epitome of excellence in the field of engineering consultancy. Over these years, the Company undertook 168 projects costing in excess of Rs.800 Billion. The fundamental principle in the implementation of these projects always remained the pursuit of excellence through hard work and honesty.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nAt BARQAAB, we feel proud of the incomparable expertise and competence of a dedicated team of 450 professionals. Meeting the expectations of our clients and justifying their trust remains the hallmark of our business strategy.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nThe Company plans to expand its business overseas. We have already signed an MOU with Mohammad Alshehhi Power L.L.C. Dubai to jointly undertake foreign and local projects. It is our expectation that the Company will continue to grow, both in the qualitative and quantitative aspects of its business. May Allah help us in this endeavor. Ameen.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<strong>Engr. Ahmad Khan Bhatti</strong>\r\nChief Executive Officer\r\n[/column_two_thirds]\r\n[column_third_last]\r\n\r\n<a href=\"https://barqaab.com.-content/uploads/2014/11/CEO_500px.jpg\"><img class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-4120\" src=\"https://barqaab.com.-content/uploads/2014/11/CEO_500px.jpg\" alt=\"CEO_500px\" width=\"500\" height=\"483\" /></a>\r\n[/column_third_last]', 'CEO MESSAGE', '', 'inherit', 'open', 'open', '', '4114-revision-v1', '', '', '2014-11-27 08:33:27', '2014-11-27 08:33:27', '', 4114, 'http://barqaab.com.pk/2014/11/4114-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
