(4450, 1, '2014-11-27 07:13:53', '2014-11-27 07:13:53', 'At Barqaab, we\'re committed to pursue excellence in consultancy and advisory services for water and power projects. We are equally committed to helping exceptional people comprehend their potential as we reward them with opportunity and challenge. We value teamwork, accountability, integrity and treat all employees with dignity and respect.\n\n<BR>We offer competitive salaries and health care benefits. We have systems in place for employees to receive recognition for their individual performance and the overall success of the organization.\n\nSubmit Your CV\n', 'CAREERS', '', 'inherit', 'open', 'open', '', '4428-autosave-v1', '', '', '2014-11-27 07:13:53', '2014-11-27 07:13:53', '', 4428, 'http://barqaab.com.pk/2014/11/4428-autosave-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
