(4686, 3, '2020-01-31 10:53:03', '2020-01-31 10:53:03', '<h2 class=\"giga\">220kV GRID STATIONS AND TRANSMISSION LINES <span class=\"accent\">\r\n</span></h2>\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>220kV/132kV SHALAMAR SUBSTATION (GIS) AND ALLIED 220KV D/C OVERHEAD TRANSMISSION LINE AND UNDERGROUND CABLE PROJECT (PHASE-I)</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Preparation of Layout Plan, Single Line Diagram, Protection Schemes, Preliminary Civil Structure Design, Technical Specifications, Bill of Quantities and Tender Documents.</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Total Project Cost</strong> - PKR 3,600 Million\r\n<strong>Barqaab Share</strong> - 100%\r\n<strong>Date of Commencement</strong> - November 2008\r\n<strong>Date of Completion</strong> - July 2009</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>SCOPE OF WORK</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\">3x160MVA, 220/132kV Transformer with Controlling Switchgear on both Sides.\r\n220kV D/C Transmission Line with Line Controlling Equipment for In/Out of one Circuit of Ravi-K.S.K Transmission Line at Shalamar (9KM Long Overhead Transmission Line and 3+3KM underground Cable).\r\n6.3MVA 13/211kV Transformer with Controlling Switchgear for Auxiliary Services.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>220kV BAHAWALPUR GRID STATION EXTENSION PROJECT</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Construction Supervision, Contract Management and Testing &amp; Commissioning for Addition of 3x160MVA 220/132kV Power Transformer Along With 220kv and 132kv Allied Equipment.</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>Total Project Cost</strong> - PKR 309 Million\r\n<strong>Barqaab Share</strong> - 100%\r\n<strong>Date of Commencement</strong> - September 2008\r\n<strong>Date of Completion</strong> - October 2009</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>SCOPE OF WORK</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">One No. 220/132kV, 3x160MVA Transformer Bay.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>220kV YOUSAFWALA GRID STATION EXTENSION PROJECT</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Construction Supervision, Contract Management and Testing &amp; Commissioning for Addition of 3x160MVA 220/132kV Power Transformer Along With 220kv and 132kv Allied Equipment.</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Total Project Cost</strong> - PKR 309 Million\r\n<strong>Barqaab Share</strong> - 100%\r\n<strong>Date of Commencement</strong> - September 2008\r\n<strong>Date of Completion</strong> - September 2009</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>SCOPE OF WORK</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\">One No. 220/132kV, 3x160MVA Transformer Bay.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>220kV HALA ROAD HYDERABAD GRID STATION EXTENSION PROJECT</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Construction Supervision, Contract Management and Testing &amp; Commissioning for Addition of 3x160MVA 220/132kV Power Transformer Along With 220kv and 132kv Allied Equipment.</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Total Project Cost</strong> - PKR 309 Million\r\n<strong>Barqaab Share</strong> - 100%\r\n<strong>Date of Commencement</strong> - September 2008\r\n<strong>Date of Completion</strong> - October 2009</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>SCOPE OF WORK</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\">One No. 220/132kV, 3x160MVA Transformer Bay.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>220kV BANNU GRID STATION EXTENSION PROJECT</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Residency Construction Supervision including Contract Administration, Quality Control, Contractors Claim Certification, Safety Programme, follow up and Revision of Construction Schedules, Monitoring and Reporting of Progress, Variation Orders and Design Changes during execution, Testing And Commissioning, Final Completion Report and Handing of Over The Project</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>Total Project Cost</strong> - PKR 309 Million\r\n<strong>Barqaab Share</strong> - 100%\r\n<strong>Date of Commencement</strong> - January 2009</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>SCOPE OF WORK</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">One No. 220/132kV, 3x160MVA Transformer Bay.\r\nTwo Nos. 220kV Line Bays.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>220kV LUDEWALA GRID STATION EXTENSION PROJECT</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Construction Supervision, Contract Management and Testing &amp; Commissioning for Addition of 3x160MVA 220/132kV Power Transformer Along With 220kv and 132kv Allied Equipment.</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Total Project Cost</strong> - PKR 309 Million\r\n<strong>Barqaab Share</strong> - 100%\r\n<strong>Date of Commencement</strong> - January 2009\r\n<strong>Date of Completion</strong> - August 2009</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>SCOPE OF WORK</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\">One No. 220/132kV, 3x160MVA Transformer Bay.\r\nTwo Nos. 220kV Line Bays.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>220KV CHASHMA - LUDEWALA TRANSMISSION LINE AND EXTENSION OF 220KV LUDEWALA GRID STATION PROJECT</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Preparation of Bid Level Design, Bill of quantities, Technical Specifications, Tender Document, Evaluation of the Bids, Residency Construction Supervision including Contract Administration, Quality Control, Contractors Claim Certification, Safety Programme, follow up and Revision of Construction Schedules, Monitoring and Reporting of Progress, Variation Orders and Design Changes during execution, Testing And Commissioning, Final Completion Report and Handing of Over The Project.</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Total Project Cost</strong> - PKR 2,057 Million\r\n<strong>Barqaab Share</strong> - 100%\r\n<strong>Date of Commencement</strong> - October 2010</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>SCOPE OF WORK</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\">170KM long 220kV Double Circuit, Twin Bundle Conductor with OPGW Transmission Line between Chashma and Ludewala.\r\nOne Complete Dia (Breaker and a Half Scheme) Comprising Two Line Bays at 220kV Ludewala Substation.\r\nPLC &amp; OPGW Terminal Equipment, SCADA/RTU and Associated Equipment at Chashma-II Substation.\r\nReplacement of PLC Equipment at 220kV Daud Khal Substation.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>220kV GAWADAR GIS GRID STATION ALONG WITH ALLIED TRANSMISSINO LINE PROJECT</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Residency Construction Supervision including Contract Administration, Quality Control, Contractors Claim Certification, Safety Programme, follow up and Revision of Construction Schedules, Monitoring and Reporting of Progress, Variation Orders and Design Changes during execution, Testing And Commissioning, Final Completion Report and Handing of Over The Project.</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Total Project Cost</strong> - PKR 2,645 Million\r\n<strong>Barqaab Share</strong> - 100%\r\n<strong>Date of Commencement</strong> - January 2011</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>SCOPE OF WORK</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\">2x250, 220/132kV Auto-Transformer.\r\n2x220kV Dia.\r\n1x6.3MVa, 132/11kV Power Transformer.\r\n6x132kV Line Bays.\r\n72KM 220kV D/C Transmission Line on “Greely” Conductor (Twin Bundle) from Iran Border to Gawadar Grid Station.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>220/132kV ROHRI TO SHIKARPUR AND ROHRI TO GAMBAT TRANSMISSION LINE PROJECT</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Residency Construction Supervision including Contract Administration, Quality Control, Contractors Claim Certification, Safety Programme, follow up and Revision of Construction Schedules, Monitoring and Reporting of Progress, Variation Orders and Design Changes during execution, Testing And Commissioning, Final Completion Report and Handing of Over The Project.</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Total Project Cost</strong> - PKR 713 Million\r\n<strong>Barqaab Share</strong> - 100%\r\n<strong>Date of Commencement</strong> - January 2009\r\n<strong>Date of Completion</strong> - June 2011</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>SCOPE OF WORK</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\">62KM long 220kV Double Circuit Twin bundle Transmission Line from 220kV Rohri Grid Station to 220kV Shikarpur Grid Station.\r\n71KM long 132kV Double Circuit Twin Bundle Transmission Line from 220kV Rohri Grid Station to 132kV Gambat Grid Station.\r\n20KM long 132kV Double Circuit Twin Bundle Transmission Line from 220kV Rohri Grid Station to 132kV Khairpur Grid Station.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>220kV D.G KHAN TO LORALAI TRANSMISSION LINE PROJECT</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Residency Construction Supervision including Contract Administration, Quality Control, Contractors Claim Certification, Safety Programme, follow up and Revision of Construction Schedules, Monitoring and Reporting of Progress, Variation Orders and Design Changes during execution, Testing And Commissioning, Final Completion Report and Handing of Over The Project.</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Total Project Cost</strong> - PKR 1,905 Million\r\n<strong>Barqaab Share</strong> - 100%\r\n<strong>Date of Commencement</strong> - September 2009\r\n<strong>Date of Completion</strong> - September 2011</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>SCOPE OF WORK</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>Lot-I:</strong>     85KM Long 220kv Double Circuit Twin Bundle Transmission Line from D.G Khan Grid Station to 220kV Loralai Grid Station (From D.G. Khan Grid Station to Location No.261).</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>Lot-II:</strong>    85KM Long 220kv Double Circuit Twin Bundle Transmission Line from D.G Khan Grid Station to 220kV Loralai Grid Station (From Location No.261 to Location No.520).</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>Lot-III:</strong>   80KM Long 220kv Double circuit Twin Bundle Transmission Line from D.G Khan Grid Station to 220kV Loralai Grid Station (From Location No.520 to Loralai Grid Station).</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>220kV LORALAI GRID STATION PROJECT</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Residency Construction Supervision including Contract Administration, Quality Control, Contractors Claim Certification, Safety Programme, follow up and Revision of Construction Schedules, Monitoring and Reporting of Progress, Variation Orders and Design Changes during execution, Testing And Commissioning, Final Completion Report and Handing of Over The Project.</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Total Project Cost</strong> - PKR 2,500 Million\r\n<strong>Barqaab Share -</strong> 100%\r\n<strong>Date of Commencement</strong> - January 2011\r\n<strong>Date of Completion</strong> - June 2012</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>SCOPE OF WORK</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\">2x250MVA, 220/132kV ATFs\r\n2x220kV Dia.\r\n6x132kV L/Bays.\r\n1x10/13MVA, 132/11kV PTF.\r\n3x132kV T/Bays.</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>220kV ROHRI AND SHIKARPUR GRID STATION EXTENSION PROJECT</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Residency Construction Supervision including Contract Administration, Quality Control, Contractors Claim Certification, Safety Programme, follow up and Revision of Construction Schedules, Monitoring and Reporting of Progress, Variation Orders and Design Changes during execution, Testing And Commissioning, Final Completion Report and Handing of Over The Project.</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>Total Project Cost</strong> - RMP 60 Millions PKR 177 Millions\r\n<strong>Barqaab Share</strong> - 100%\r\n<strong>Date of Commencement</strong> - May 2010\r\n<strong>Date of Completion</strong> - December 2011</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>SCOPE OF WORK</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>220kV Rohri Grid Station</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><em>220kV Equipment (One and a Half Breaker Scheme)</em></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Two Nos. Transformer Bays with 220kV MVA 220/132kV Transformers along with Allied Equipment.\r\nFour (04) Nos. Line Bay.\r\nTwo No. Power Transformer Bay.\r\nTelecommunication, SCADA, Protection, Control Metering and Associated Foundations (Civil Works).</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><em>132kV Equipment</em></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Six 132kV Line Bays.\r\nTwo Nos. Transformer Bays.\r\nTelecommunication, Protection, Control Metering and Associated Foundations (Civil Works).\r\nTwo (02) Nos. Power Transformer Bay.\r\nOne (01) No. Bus Coupler Bay.\r\nOne No. Auxiliary Transformer Bay with 6.3 MVA, 132kV/11kV Auxiliary Transformer along with Allied Equipment.</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>220kV Shikarpur Grid Station</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><em>220kV Equipment (One and a Half Breaker Scheme)</em></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Two (02) Nos. 220kV Line Bays.\r\nBus bar works (extension) in order to accommodate one dia.\r\nTelecommunication, SCADA, Protection, Control Metering and Associated Foundations (Civil Works).\r\nAssociated Civil Works Foundations, Trenches, Walk way etc.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>220kV CHISHTIAN GRID STATION AND ASSOCIATED TRANSMISSION LINE PROJECT</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Residency Construction Supervision including Contract Administration, Quality Control, Contractors Claim Certification, Safety Programme, follow up and Revision of Construction Schedules, Monitoring and Reporting of Progress, Variation Orders and Design Changes during execution, Testing And Commissioning, Final Completion Report and Handing of Over The Project.</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>Total Project Cost</strong> - PKR 2,633 Millions\r\n<strong>Barqaab Share</strong> - 100%\r\n<strong>Date of Commencement</strong> - October 2010\r\n<strong>Date of Completion</strong> - January 2012</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>SCOPE OF WORK</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">2x160MVA, 220/132kV ATF.\r\n2x220kV Dia.\r\n1x6.3MVA, 132/11kV PTF.\r\n6x132kV Line Bays.\r\nAssociated Civil Works Foundations, Trenches, Walk way etc.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>220kV AIS GRID STATION AT KASSOWAL AND ASSOCIATED TRANSMISSION LINES</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Residency Construction Supervision including Contract Administration, Quality Control, Contractors Claim Certification, Safety Programme, follow up and Revision of Construction Schedules, Monitoring and Reporting of Progress, Variation Orders and Design Changes during execution, Testing And Commissioning, Final Completion Report and Handing of Over The Project.</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>Total Project Cost</strong> - RMB 55 Millions + PKR 365 Millions\r\n<strong>Barqaab Share - </strong>100%\r\n<strong>Date of Commencement - </strong>February 2010\r\n<strong>Date of Completion</strong> - March 2012</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>SCOPE OF WORK</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>Lot-I</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Kassowal 220 kV Grid Station:\r\n2 x 160 MVA, 220/132kV auto-transformers.\r\n4 x 220kV line bays, 2 x 220kV transformer bays, 6 x 132kV line bays and 2 x 132kV transformer bays.\r\n1 x 6.3 MVA, 132/11.5kV power transformer with controlling switchgear at 132kV side.\r\nControl house building.\r\n132kV relay building.</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>Lot-II</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Two Twin Bundle, Double Circuit T/Lines for In &amp; Out of Existing 220kV Vehari-Yousafwala D/C T/Line.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>220 kV KHUZDAR - DADU TRANSMISSION LINE AND EXTENSION OF GRIDSTATION AT BOTH ENDS AS A JOINT VENTURE PARTNER WITH NESPAK</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Preparation of Bid Level Design, Bill of quantities, Technical Specifications, Tender Document, Evaluation of the Bids, Residency Construction Supervision including Contract Administration, Quality Control, Contractors Claim Certification, Safety Programme, follow up and Revision of Construction Schedules, Monitoring and Reporting of Progress, Variation Orders and Design Changes during execution, Testing And Commissioning, Final Completion Report and Handing of Over The Project.</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>SCOPE OF WORK</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">300KM long 220kV Double Circuit Dadu-Khuzdar Transmission Line.\r\n2x160MVA Auto Transformer with interfacing to existing 132kV Busbar at Khuzdar Grid Station.\r\nTwo 220kV Line Bays at Khuzdar Grid Station.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>220kV WAPDA TOWN, LAHORE GRID STATION AND ALLIED TRANSMISSION LINE PROJECT</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Residency Construction Supervision including Contract Administration, Quality Control, Contractors Claim Certification, Safety Programme, follow up and Revision of Construction Schedules, Monitoring and Reporting of Progress, Variation Orders and Design Changes during execution, Testing And Commissioning, Final Completion Report and Handing of Over The Project. Working as Joint Venture Partner with NESPAK.</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Total Project Cost</strong>  - PKR 470 Million\r\n<strong>Barqaab Share  - </strong>100%\r\n<strong>Date of Commencement</strong> - January 2009\r\n<strong>Date of Completion</strong>  - June 2010</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>SCOPE OF WORK</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\">220kV GIS Plant with allied Transformer and Line Bays.\r\n3x160MVA Transformers.\r\n20KM long 220kV D/C Transmission Line.\r\nAssociated Civil Works Foundations, Trenches, Walk way etc.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>220kV/132kV SHALAMAR SUBSTATION (GIS) AND ALLIED 220kV D/C OVERHEAD TRANSMISSION LINE AND UNDERGROUND CABLE PROJECT (PHASE-II)</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Residency Construction Supervision including Contract Administration, Quality Control, Contractors Claim Certification, Safety Programme, follow up and Revision of Construction Schedules, Monitoring and Reporting of Progress, Variation Orders and Design Changes during execution, Testing And Commissioning, Final Completion Report and Handing of Over The Project.</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>Total Project Cost</strong> - PKR 3600 Million\r\n<strong>Barqaab Share</strong> - 100%\r\n<strong>Date of Commencement</strong> - May 2010\r\n<strong>Date of Completion</strong> - June 2012</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>SCOPE OF WORK</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">3x160MVA, 220/132kV Transformer with Controlling Switchgear on both Sides.\r\n220kV D/C Transmission Line with Line Controlling Equipment for In/Out of one Circuit of Ravi-K.S.K Transmission Line at Shalamar (9KM Long Overhead Transmission Line and 3+3KM underground Cable).\r\n6.3MVA 13/211kV Transformer with Controlling Switchgear for Auxiliary Services.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>', '220Kv GRID STATIONS AND TRANSMISSIONS LINES', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', '220kv-grid-stations-and-transmission-lines', '', '', '2020-01-31 13:21:40', '2020-01-31 13:21:40', '', 0, 'http://barqaab.com.pk/?post_type=portfolios&#038;p=4686', 1, 'portfolios', '', 0),
(4688, 3, '2020-01-31 12:00:47', '2020-01-31 12:00:47', '<h1 align=\"justify\">132kV GRID STATIONS AND TRANSMISSION LINES</h1>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>NEW 132KV GANGAL GRID STATION PROJECT</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Preparation of Bid Level Design, Bill of Quantities, Technical Specifications, Tender Documents and Evaluation of Bids of the Project Funded by the World Bank under Jurisdiction of Islamabad Electric Power Supply Company (IESCO).</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>NEW 132KV MES RAWALPINDI GRID STATION PROJECT</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Preparation of Bid Level Design, Bill of Quantities, Technical Specifications, Tender Documents and Evaluation of Bids of the Project Funded by the World Bank under Jurisdiction of Islamabad Electric Power Supply Company (IESCO).</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>NEW 132KV ADYALA GRID STATION PROJECT</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Preparation of Bid Level Design, Bill of Quantities, Technical Specifications, Tender Documents and Evaluation of Bids of the Project Funded by the World Bank under Jurisdiction of Islamabad Electric Power Supply Company (IESCO).</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>NEW 132KV BEHTAR MORE GRID STATION PROJECT</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Preparation of Bid Level Design, Bill of Quantities, Technical Specifications, Tender Documents and Evaluation of Bids of the Project Funded by the World Bank under Jurisdiction of Islamabad Electric Power Supply Company (IESCO).</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>132KV SOHAWA GRID STATION PROJECT</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Preparation of Bid Level Design, Bill of Quantities, Technical Specifications, Tender Documents and Evaluation of Bids of the Project Funded by the World Bank under Jurisdiction of Islamabad Electric Power Supply Company (IESCO).</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>132KV NEW JHELUM GRID STATION PROJECT</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Preparation of Bid Level Design, Bill of Quantities, Technical Specifications, Tender Documents and Evaluation of Bids of the Project Funded by the World Bank under Jurisdiction of Islamabad Electric Power Supply Company (IESCO).</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>REPLACING EXISTING (CONVERSION) 66KV TO 132KV DANDOT GRID STATION PROJECT</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Preparation of Bid Level Design, Bill of Quantities, Technical Specifications, Tender Documents and Evaluation of Bids of the Project Funded by the World Bank under Jurisdiction of Islamabad Electric Power Supply Company (IESCO).</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>REPLACING EXISTING (CONVERSION) 66KV TO 132KV PINANWAL GRID STATION PROJECT</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Preparation of Bid Level Design, Bill of Quantities, Technical Specifications, Tender Documents and Evaluation of Bids of the Project Funded by the World Bank under Jurisdiction of Islamabad Electric Power Supply Company (IESCO).</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>REPLACING EXISTING (CONVERSION) 66KV TO 132KV AHMADAL GRID STATION PROJECT</strong>\r\nPreparation of Bid Level Design, Bill of Quantities, Technical Specifications, Tender Documents and Evaluation of Bids of the Project Funded by the World Bank under Jurisdiction of Islamabad Electric Power Supply Company (IESCO).</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>REPLACING EXISTING (CONVERSION) 66KV TO 132KV PINDI GHEB GRID STATION PROJECT</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Preparation of Bid Level Design, Bill of Quantities, Technical Specifications, Tender Documents and Evaluation of Bids of the Project Funded by the World Bank under Jurisdiction of Islamabad Electric Power Supply Company (IESCO).</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>REPLACING EXISTING (CONVERSION) 66KV TO 132KV HAJEERA GRID STATION PROJECT</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Preparation of Bid Level Design, Bill of Quantities, Technical Specifications, Tender Documents and Evaluation of Bids of the Project Funded by the World Bank under Jurisdiction of Islamabad Electric Power Supply Company (IESCO).</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>REPLACING EXISTING (CONVERSION) 66KV TO 132KV PALANDARI GRID STATION PROJECT</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Preparation of Bid Level Design, Bill of Quantities, Technical Specifications, Tender Documents and Evaluation of Bids of the Project Funded by the World Bank under Jurisdiction of Islamabad Electric Power Supply Company (IESCO).</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>REPLACING EXISTING (CONVERSION) 66KV TO 132KV MINHASA GRID STATION PROJECT</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Preparation of Bid Level Design, Bill of Quantities, Technical Specifications, Tender Documents and Evaluation of Bids of the Project Funded by the World Bank under Jurisdiction of Islamabad Electric Power Supply Company (IESCO).</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>EXTENSION OF LINE BAYS OF 132KV AZAD PATTAN GRID STATION PROJECT</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Preparation of Bid Level Design, Bill of Quantities, Technical Specifications, Tender Documents and Evaluation of Bids of the Project Funded by the World Bank under Jurisdiction of Islamabad Electric Power Supply Company (IESCO).</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>EXTENSION OF LINE BAYS OF 132KV C.S SHAH GRID STATION PROJECT</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Preparation of Bid Level Design, Bill of Quantities, Technical Specifications, Tender Documents and Evaluation of Bids of the Project Funded by the World Bank under Jurisdiction of Islamabad Electric Power Supply Company (IESCO).</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>EXTENSION OF LINE BAYS OF 132KV TARARKHAL, PIRWADAI GRID STATION PROJECT</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Preparation of Bid Level Design, Bill of Quantities, Technical Specifications, Tender Documents and Evaluation of Bids of the Project Funded by the World Bank under Jurisdiction of Islamabad Electric Power Supply Company (IESCO).</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>EXTENSION OF LINE BAYS OF 132KV MUREE GRID STATION PROJECT</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Preparation of Bid Level Design, Bill of Quantities, Technical Specifications, Tender Documents and Evaluation of Bids of the Project Funded by the World Bank under Jurisdiction of Islamabad Electric Power Supply Company (IESCO).</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>132kV RAWAT TO CHAKERI TRANSMISSION LINE</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Preparation of Bid Level Design, Bill of Quantities, Technical Specifications, Tender Documents and Evaluation of Bids of the Project Funded by the World Bank under Jurisdiction of Islamabad Electric Power Supply Company (IESCO).</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>132kV BURHAN TO MARGALLA TRANSMISSION LINE</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Preparation of Bid Level Design, Bill of Quantities, Technical Specifications, Tender Documents and Evaluation of Bids of the Project Funded by the World Bank under Jurisdiction of Islamabad Electric Power Supply Company (IESCO).</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>132kV TARAKHAL TO HAJEERA TRANSMISSION LINE</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Preparation of Bid Level Design, Bill of Quantities, Technical Specifications, Tender Documents and Evaluation of Bids of the Project Funded by the World Bank under Jurisdiction of Islamabad Electric Power Supply Company (IESCO).</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>132kV TARARKHAL TO PALANDARI TRANSMISSION LINE</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Preparation of Bid Level Design, Bill of Quantities, Technical Specifications, Tender Documents and Evaluation of Bids of the Project Funded by the World Bank under Jurisdiction of Islamabad Electric Power Supply Company (IESCO).</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>132kV AZAD PATTAN TO PLANDAO TRANSMISSION LINE</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Preparation of Bid Level Design, Bill of Quantities, Technical Specifications, Tender Documents and Evaluation of Bids of the Project Funded by the World Bank under Jurisdiction of Islamabad Electric Power Supply Company (IESCO).</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>132kV CHAK SAWAI TO KOTLI TRANSMISSION LINE</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Preparation of Bid Level Design, Bill of Quantities, Technical Specifications, Tender Documents and Evaluation of Bids of the Project Funded by the World Bank under Jurisdiction of Islamabad Electric Power Supply Company (IESCO).</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>132kV C.S.SHAL TO DANDOT TRANSMISSION LINE</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Preparation of Bid Level Design, Bill of Quantities, Technical Specifications, Tender Documents and Evaluation of Bids of the Project Funded by the World Bank under Jurisdiction of Islamabad Electric Power Supply Company (IESCO).</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>132kV FATEH JANG TO AHMADALA TRANSMISSION LINE</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Preparation of Bid Level Design, Bill of Quantities, Technical Specifications, Tender Documents and Evaluation of Bids of the Project Funded by the World Bank under Jurisdiction of Islamabad Electric Power Supply Company (IESCO).</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>132kV AHMADALA TO PINDI GHEB TRANSMISSION LINE</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Preparation of Bid Level Design, Bill of Quantities, Technical Specifications, Tender Documents and Evaluation of Bids of the Project Funded by the World Bank under Jurisdiction of Islamabad Electric Power Supply Company (IESCO).</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>132kV DANDOT TO PINANWAL TRANSMISSION LINE</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Preparation of Bid Level Design, Bill of Quantities, Technical Specifications, Tender Documents and Evaluation of Bids of the Project Funded by the World Bank under Jurisdiction of Islamabad Electric Power Supply Company (IESCO).</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>132/11.5KV GRID STATION AND OVERHEAD ELECTRICAL INFRASTRUCTURE OF MULTAN INDUSTRIAL ESTATE PHASE-II</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Preparation of Tender Documents, Bill of Quantities, Technical Specifications Tender Evaluation and Design of Grid Station and Overhead Electrical Infrastructure.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>132kV GIS MOMINPURA GRIDSTATION ALONG WITH ASSOCIATED TRANSMISSION LINE</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Preparation of Bid Level Design, Bill of Quantities, Technical Specifications, Tender Documents and Evaluation of Bids and Construction Supervision of the Project under 6th STG project LESCO.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>132kV GIS GULBERG GRIDSTATION ALONG WITH ASSOCIATED TRANSMISSION LINE</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Preparation of Bid Level Design, Bill of Quantities, Technical Specifications, Tender Documents and Evaluation of Bids and Construction Supervision of the Project under 6th STG project LESCO.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>132kV GIS SAGGIAN GRIDSTATION ALONG WITH ASSOCIATED TRANSMISSION LINE</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Preparation of Bid Level Design, Bill of Quantities, Technical Specifications, Tender Documents and Evaluation of Bids and Construction Supervision of the Project under 6th STG project LESCO.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>132kV GIS INAYATPURA GRIDSTATION ALONG WITH ASSOCIATED TRANSMISSION LINE</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Preparation of Bid Level Design, Bill of Quantities, Technical Specifications, Tender Documents and Evaluation of Bids and Construction Supervision of the Project under 6th STG project LESCO.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>132kV GIS BARKI GRIDSTATION ALONG WITH ASSOCIATED TRANSMISSION LINE</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Preparation of Bid Level Design, Bill of Quantities, Technical Specifications, Tender Documents and Evaluation of Bids and Construction Supervision of the Project under 6th STG project LESCO.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>3X132KV GRID STATIONS AND 700 NEW VILLAGES ELECTRIFICATIN UNDER 2nd RURAL ELECTRIFICATION PROJECT</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Preparation of Tender Evaluation and Construction Supervision of Extending Electricity Supply To 700 New Villages / Settlements And Construction Of 3x132kv Grid Stations Along With Associated Transmission Lines, for Extending Electricity Facilities to 25600 General, 70 Industrial And 200 Tubewell Consumers.</p>', '132kV GRID STATIONS AND TRANSMISSION LINES', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', '132kv-grid-stations-and-transmission-lines', '', '', '2020-01-31 14:19:14', '2020-01-31 14:19:14', '', 0, 'http://barqaab.com.pk/?post_type=portfolios&#038;p=4688', 2, 'portfolios', '', 0);
INSERT INTO `wp_bbey_posts` (`ID`, `post_author`, `post_date`, `post_date_gmt`, `post_content`, `post_title`, `post_excerpt`, `post_status`, `comment_status`, `ping_status`, `post_password`, `post_name`, `to_ping`, `pinged`, `post_modified`, `post_modified_gmt`, `post_content_filtered`, `post_parent`, `guid`, `menu_order`, `post_type`, `post_mime_type`, `comment_count`) VALUES
(4687, 3, '2020-01-31 10:53:33', '2020-01-31 10:53:33', '<h1 class=\"giga\">220kV GRID STATIONS AND TRANSMISSIONS <span class=\"accent\">\r\n</span></h1>\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>220kV/132kV SHALAMAR SUBSTATION (GIS) AND ALLIED 220KV D/C OVERHEAD TRANSMISSION LINE AND UNDERGROUND CABLE PROJECT (PHASE-I)</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Preparation of Layout Plan, Single Line Diagram, Protection Schemes, Preliminary Civil Structure Design, Technical Specifications, Bill of Quantities and Tender Documents.</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Total Project Cost</strong> - PKR 3,600 Million\r\n<strong>Barqaab Share</strong> - 100%\r\n<strong>Date of Commencement</strong> - November 2008\r\n<strong>Date of Completion</strong> - July 2009</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>SCOPE OF WORK</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\">3x160MVA, 220/132kV Transformer with Controlling Switchgear on both Sides.\r\n220kV D/C Transmission Line with Line Controlling Equipment for In/Out of one Circuit of Ravi-K.S.K Transmission Line at Shalamar (9KM Long Overhead Transmission Line and 3+3KM underground Cable).\r\n6.3MVA 13/211kV Transformer with Controlling Switchgear for Auxiliary Services.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>220kV BAHAWALPUR GRID STATION EXTENSION PROJECT</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Construction Supervision, Contract Management and Testing &amp; Commissioning for Addition of 3x160MVA 220/132kV Power Transformer Along With 220kv and 132kv Allied Equipment.</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>Total Project Cost</strong> - PKR 309 Million\r\n<strong>Barqaab Share</strong> - 100%\r\n<strong>Date of Commencement</strong> - September 2008\r\n<strong>Date of Completion</strong> - October 2009</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>SCOPE OF WORK</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">One No. 220/132kV, 3x160MVA Transformer Bay.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>220kV YOUSAFWALA GRID STATION EXTENSION PROJECT</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Construction Supervision, Contract Management and Testing &amp; Commissioning for Addition of 3x160MVA 220/132kV Power Transformer Along With 220kv and 132kv Allied Equipment.</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Total Project Cost</strong> - PKR 309 Million\r\n<strong>Barqaab Share</strong> - 100%\r\n<strong>Date of Commencement</strong> - September 2008\r\n<strong>Date of Completion</strong> - September 2009</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>SCOPE OF WORK</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\">One No. 220/132kV, 3x160MVA Transformer Bay.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>220kV HALA ROAD HYDERABAD GRID STATION EXTENSION PROJECT</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Construction Supervision, Contract Management and Testing &amp; Commissioning for Addition of 3x160MVA 220/132kV Power Transformer Along With 220kv and 132kv Allied Equipment.</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Total Project Cost</strong> - PKR 309 Million\r\n<strong>Barqaab Share</strong> - 100%\r\n<strong>Date of Commencement</strong> - September 2008\r\n<strong>Date of Completion</strong> - October 2009</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>SCOPE OF WORK</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\">One No. 220/132kV, 3x160MVA Transformer Bay.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>220kV BANNU GRID STATION EXTENSION PROJECT</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Residency Construction Supervision including Contract Administration, Quality Control, Contractors Claim Certification, Safety Programme, follow up and Revision of Construction Schedules, Monitoring and Reporting of Progress, Variation Orders and Design Changes during execution, Testing And Commissioning, Final Completion Report and Handing of Over The Project</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>Total Project Cost</strong> - PKR 309 Million\r\n<strong>Barqaab Share</strong> - 100%\r\n<strong>Date of Commencement</strong> - January 2009</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>SCOPE OF WORK</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">One No. 220/132kV, 3x160MVA Transformer Bay.\r\nTwo Nos. 220kV Line Bays.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>220kV LUDEWALA GRID STATION EXTENSION PROJECT</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Construction Supervision, Contract Management and Testing &amp; Commissioning for Addition of 3x160MVA 220/132kV Power Transformer Along With 220kv and 132kv Allied Equipment.</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Total Project Cost</strong> - PKR 309 Million\r\n<strong>Barqaab Share</strong> - 100%\r\n<strong>Date of Commencement</strong> - January 2009\r\n<strong>Date of Completion</strong> - August 2009</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>SCOPE OF WORK</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\">One No. 220/132kV, 3x160MVA Transformer Bay.\r\nTwo Nos. 220kV Line Bays.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>220KV CHASHMA - LUDEWALA TRANSMISSION LINE AND EXTENSION OF 220KV LUDEWALA GRID STATION PROJECT</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Preparation of Bid Level Design, Bill of quantities, Technical Specifications, Tender Document, Evaluation of the Bids, Residency Construction Supervision including Contract Administration, Quality Control, Contractors Claim Certification, Safety Programme, follow up and Revision of Construction Schedules, Monitoring and Reporting of Progress, Variation Orders and Design Changes during execution, Testing And Commissioning, Final Completion Report and Handing of Over The Project.</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Total Project Cost</strong> - PKR 2,057 Million\r\n<strong>Barqaab Share</strong> - 100%\r\n<strong>Date of Commencement</strong> - October 2010</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>SCOPE OF WORK</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\">170KM long 220kV Double Circuit, Twin Bundle Conductor with OPGW Transmission Line between Chashma and Ludewala.\r\nOne Complete Dia (Breaker and a Half Scheme) Comprising Two Line Bays at 220kV Ludewala Substation.\r\nPLC &amp; OPGW Terminal Equipment, SCADA/RTU and Associated Equipment at Chashma-II Substation.\r\nReplacement of PLC Equipment at 220kV Daud Khal Substation.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>220kV GAWADAR GIS GRID STATION ALONG WITH ALLIED TRANSMISSINO LINE PROJECT</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Residency Construction Supervision including Contract Administration, Quality Control, Contractors Claim Certification, Safety Programme, follow up and Revision of Construction Schedules, Monitoring and Reporting of Progress, Variation Orders and Design Changes during execution, Testing And Commissioning, Final Completion Report and Handing of Over The Project.</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Total Project Cost</strong> - PKR 2,645 Million\r\n<strong>Barqaab Share</strong> - 100%\r\n<strong>Date of Commencement</strong> - January 2011</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>SCOPE OF WORK</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\">2x250, 220/132kV Auto-Transformer.\r\n2x220kV Dia.\r\n1x6.3MVa, 132/11kV Power Transformer.\r\n6x132kV Line Bays.\r\n72KM 220kV D/C Transmission Line on “Greely” Conductor (Twin Bundle) from Iran Border to Gawadar Grid Station.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>220/132kV ROHRI TO SHIKARPUR AND ROHRI TO GAMBAT TRANSMISSION LINE PROJECT</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Residency Construction Supervision including Contract Administration, Quality Control, Contractors Claim Certification, Safety Programme, follow up and Revision of Construction Schedules, Monitoring and Reporting of Progress, Variation Orders and Design Changes during execution, Testing And Commissioning, Final Completion Report and Handing of Over The Project.</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Total Project Cost</strong> - PKR 713 Million\r\n<strong>Barqaab Share</strong> - 100%\r\n<strong>Date of Commencement</strong> - January 2009\r\n<strong>Date of Completion</strong> - June 2011</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>SCOPE OF WORK</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\">62KM long 220kV Double Circuit Twin bundle Transmission Line from 220kV Rohri Grid Station to 220kV Shikarpur Grid Station.\r\n71KM long 132kV Double Circuit Twin Bundle Transmission Line from 220kV Rohri Grid Station to 132kV Gambat Grid Station.\r\n20KM long 132kV Double Circuit Twin Bundle Transmission Line from 220kV Rohri Grid Station to 132kV Khairpur Grid Station.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>220kV D.G KHAN TO LORALAI TRANSMISSION LINE PROJECT</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Residency Construction Supervision including Contract Administration, Quality Control, Contractors Claim Certification, Safety Programme, follow up and Revision of Construction Schedules, Monitoring and Reporting of Progress, Variation Orders and Design Changes during execution, Testing And Commissioning, Final Completion Report and Handing of Over The Project.</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Total Project Cost</strong> - PKR 1,905 Million\r\n<strong>Barqaab Share</strong> - 100%\r\n<strong>Date of Commencement</strong> - September 2009\r\n<strong>Date of Completion</strong> - September 2011</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>SCOPE OF WORK</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>Lot-I:</strong>     85KM Long 220kv Double Circuit Twin Bundle Transmission Line from D.G Khan Grid Station to 220kV Loralai Grid Station (From D.G. Khan Grid Station to Location No.261).</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>Lot-II:</strong>    85KM Long 220kv Double Circuit Twin Bundle Transmission Line from D.G Khan Grid Station to 220kV Loralai Grid Station (From Location No.261 to Location No.520).</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>Lot-III:</strong>   80KM Long 220kv Double circuit Twin Bundle Transmission Line from D.G Khan Grid Station to 220kV Loralai Grid Station (From Location No.520 to Loralai Grid Station).</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>220kV LORALAI GRID STATION PROJECT</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Residency Construction Supervision including Contract Administration, Quality Control, Contractors Claim Certification, Safety Programme, follow up and Revision of Construction Schedules, Monitoring and Reporting of Progress, Variation Orders and Design Changes during execution, Testing And Commissioning, Final Completion Report and Handing of Over The Project.</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Total Project Cost</strong> - PKR 2,500 Million\r\n<strong>Barqaab Share -</strong> 100%\r\n<strong>Date of Commencement</strong> - January 2011\r\n<strong>Date of Completion</strong> - June 2012</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>SCOPE OF WORK</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\">2x250MVA, 220/132kV ATFs\r\n2x220kV Dia.\r\n6x132kV L/Bays.\r\n1x10/13MVA, 132/11kV PTF.\r\n3x132kV T/Bays.</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>220kV ROHRI AND SHIKARPUR GRID STATION EXTENSION PROJECT</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Residency Construction Supervision including Contract Administration, Quality Control, Contractors Claim Certification, Safety Programme, follow up and Revision of Construction Schedules, Monitoring and Reporting of Progress, Variation Orders and Design Changes during execution, Testing And Commissioning, Final Completion Report and Handing of Over The Project.</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>Total Project Cost</strong> - RMP 60 Millions PKR 177 Millions\r\n<strong>Barqaab Share</strong> - 100%\r\n<strong>Date of Commencement</strong> - May 2010\r\n<strong>Date of Completion</strong> - December 2011</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>SCOPE OF WORK</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>220kV Rohri Grid Station</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><em>220kV Equipment (One and a Half Breaker Scheme)</em></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Two Nos. Transformer Bays with 220kV MVA 220/132kV Transformers along with Allied Equipment.\r\nFour (04) Nos. Line Bay.\r\nTwo No. Power Transformer Bay.\r\nTelecommunication, SCADA, Protection, Control Metering and Associated Foundations (Civil Works).</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><em>132kV Equipment</em></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Six 132kV Line Bays.\r\nTwo Nos. Transformer Bays.\r\nTelecommunication, Protection, Control Metering and Associated Foundations (Civil Works).\r\nTwo (02) Nos. Power Transformer Bay.\r\nOne (01) No. Bus Coupler Bay.\r\nOne No. Auxiliary Transformer Bay with 6.3 MVA, 132kV/11kV Auxiliary Transformer along with Allied Equipment.</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>220kV Shikarpur Grid Station</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><em>220kV Equipment (One and a Half Breaker Scheme)</em></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Two (02) Nos. 220kV Line Bays.\r\nBus bar works (extension) in order to accommodate one dia.\r\nTelecommunication, SCADA, Protection, Control Metering and Associated Foundations (Civil Works).\r\nAssociated Civil Works Foundations, Trenches, Walk way etc.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>220kV CHISHTIAN GRID STATION AND ASSOCIATED TRANSMISSION LINE PROJECT</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Residency Construction Supervision including Contract Administration, Quality Control, Contractors Claim Certification, Safety Programme, follow up and Revision of Construction Schedules, Monitoring and Reporting of Progress, Variation Orders and Design Changes during execution, Testing And Commissioning, Final Completion Report and Handing of Over The Project.</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>Total Project Cost</strong> - PKR 2,633 Millions\r\n<strong>Barqaab Share</strong> - 100%\r\n<strong>Date of Commencement</strong> - October 2010\r\n<strong>Date of Completion</strong> - January 2012</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>SCOPE OF WORK</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">2x160MVA, 220/132kV ATF.\r\n2x220kV Dia.\r\n1x6.3MVA, 132/11kV PTF.\r\n6x132kV Line Bays.\r\nAssociated Civil Works Foundations, Trenches, Walk way etc.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>220kV AIS GRID STATION AT KASSOWAL AND ASSOCIATED TRANSMISSION LINES</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Residency Construction Supervision including Contract Administration, Quality Control, Contractors Claim Certification, Safety Programme, follow up and Revision of Construction Schedules, Monitoring and Reporting of Progress, Variation Orders and Design Changes during execution, Testing And Commissioning, Final Completion Report and Handing of Over The Project.</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>Total Project Cost</strong> - RMB 55 Millions + PKR 365 Millions\r\n<strong>Barqaab Share - </strong>100%\r\n<strong>Date of Commencement - </strong>February 2010\r\n<strong>Date of Completion</strong> - March 2012</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>SCOPE OF WORK</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>Lot-I</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Kassowal 220 kV Grid Station:\r\n2 x 160 MVA, 220/132kV auto-transformers.\r\n4 x 220kV line bays, 2 x 220kV transformer bays, 6 x 132kV line bays and 2 x 132kV transformer bays.\r\n1 x 6.3 MVA, 132/11.5kV power transformer with controlling switchgear at 132kV side.\r\nControl house building.\r\n132kV relay building.</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>Lot-II</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Two Twin Bundle, Double Circuit T/Lines for In &amp; Out of Existing 220kV Vehari-Yousafwala D/C T/Line.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>220 kV KHUZDAR - DADU TRANSMISSION LINE AND EXTENSION OF GRIDSTATION AT BOTH ENDS AS A JOINT VENTURE PARTNER WITH NESPAK</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Preparation of Bid Level Design, Bill of quantities, Technical Specifications, Tender Document, Evaluation of the Bids, Residency Construction Supervision including Contract Administration, Quality Control, Contractors Claim Certification, Safety Programme, follow up and Revision of Construction Schedules, Monitoring and Reporting of Progress, Variation Orders and Design Changes during execution, Testing And Commissioning, Final Completion Report and Handing of Over The Project.</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>SCOPE OF WORK</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">300KM long 220kV Double Circuit Dadu-Khuzdar Transmission Line.\r\n2x160MVA Auto Transformer with interfacing to existing 132kV Busbar at Khuzdar Grid Station.\r\nTwo 220kV Line Bays at Khuzdar Grid Station.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>220kV WAPDA TOWN, LAHORE GRID STATION AND ALLIED TRANSMISSION LINE PROJECT</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Residency Construction Supervision including Contract Administration, Quality Control, Contractors Claim Certification, Safety Programme, follow up and Revision of Construction Schedules, Monitoring and Reporting of Progress, Variation Orders and Design Changes during execution, Testing And Commissioning, Final Completion Report and Handing of Over The Project. Working as Joint Venture Partner with NESPAK.</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Total Project Cost</strong>  - PKR 470 Million\r\n<strong>Barqaab Share  - </strong>100%\r\n<strong>Date of Commencement</strong> - January 2009\r\n<strong>Date of Completion</strong>  - June 2010</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>SCOPE OF WORK</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\">220kV GIS Plant with allied Transformer and Line Bays.\r\n3x160MVA Transformers.\r\n20KM long 220kV D/C Transmission Line.\r\nAssociated Civil Works Foundations, Trenches, Walk way etc.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>220kV/132kV SHALAMAR SUBSTATION (GIS) AND ALLIED 220kV D/C OVERHEAD TRANSMISSION LINE AND UNDERGROUND CABLE PROJECT (PHASE-II)</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Residency Construction Supervision including Contract Administration, Quality Control, Contractors Claim Certification, Safety Programme, follow up and Revision of Construction Schedules, Monitoring and Reporting of Progress, Variation Orders and Design Changes during execution, Testing And Commissioning, Final Completion Report and Handing of Over The Project.</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>Total Project Cost</strong> - PKR 3600 Million\r\n<strong>Barqaab Share</strong> - 100%\r\n<strong>Date of Commencement</strong> - May 2010\r\n<strong>Date of Completion</strong> - June 2012</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>SCOPE OF WORK</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">3x160MVA, 220/132kV Transformer with Controlling Switchgear on both Sides.\r\n220kV D/C Transmission Line with Line Controlling Equipment for In/Out of one Circuit of Ravi-K.S.K Transmission Line at Shalamar (9KM Long Overhead Transmission Line and 3+3KM underground Cable).\r\n6.3MVA 13/211kV Transformer with Controlling Switchgear for Auxiliary Services.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>NATIONAL TRANSMISSION AND DESPATCH COMPANY (NTDC) CAPACITY BUILDING PROJECT</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\">The main objective of the technical assistance was to undertake institutional capacity building of NTDC with the intent of preparing NTDC to professionally manage the power transmission, dispatch, and trading activities stipulated in its license. This institutional capacity building would develop and implement more efficient and effective information gathering, planning, and operating procedures for the transmission system operations, and the market operations of NTDC, resulting in a more efficient and transparent power sector. The output of the TA will be the</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Establishment of NTDC’s business functions as per its license, as well as financial and technical segregation of said functions.</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Ensure that institutional frameworks for the design and planning business segments are introduced, and</p>\r\n<p class=\"style11\" style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"justify\">Development of an integrated training program for each business function.  Working as Joint Venture Partner with Economic Consulting Associates Limited, U.K.  Project funded by Asian Development Bank (ADB).</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>', '220Kv Grid Stations and Transmission Lines', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '4686-autosave-v1', '', '', '2020-01-31 10:53:33', '2020-01-31 10:53:33', '', 4686, 'http://barqaab.com.pk/2020/01/4686-autosave-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
